  └────────────┴──────────────────┴────────┘

  **Key observations:**
  • Two FederationGuids = two physical devices
  • LOC-000001 appears in both (same location, different equipment)
  • Full history preserved — query CIRID 550e8400-...
    to see what was there before
  • MMS can trace: 234442 replaced 234441 at LOC-000001
end note

